#. Description of the plugin
#: verification-expiry-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Give a vendor's verified status an expiry date, per vendor or site-wide, so vendors must keep their profile up to date to stay verified."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:130
msgid "1 month"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:131
msgid "3 months"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:132
msgid "6 months"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:133
msgid "1 year"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: the period chosen under HivePress, Settings, Verification Expiry, e.g. "3 months".
#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:352
#, php-format
msgid "Site default (%s)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:354
msgid "Site default (does not expire)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:360
#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:405
msgid "Does not expire"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:363
msgid "Verification Period"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:364
msgid "How long each verification lasts. The date below is filled in from this each time the vendor is verified, and again whenever this choice changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:372
msgid "Verified Until"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:373
msgid "The day after this date the verified status is removed and the vendor is emailed. Pick a date of your own, or leave it to be filled in from the period above. Blank means it does not expire."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:391
msgid "Verification Expiry"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:396
msgid "Verified Vendors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:397
msgid "A verified vendor keeps the badge until the date on their profile passes; then it is removed and they are emailed to bring their details up to date. These defaults apply to every vendor unless a different period is chosen on that vendor's own edit screen. Changing the default here does not move dates already set; select vendors on the Vendors screen and use the \"Apply verification period\" bulk action for that. Both emails can be reworded under HivePress, Emails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:402
msgid "Default Verification Period"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:403
msgid "How long a verification lasts unless the vendor's own edit screen says otherwise. \"Does not expire\" keeps the current HivePress behaviour, where a verified vendor stays verified until you untick the box."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:410
msgid "Reminder (days before expiry)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:411
msgid "Email the vendor this many days before their verified status ends, so they can update their details in time. Set 0 to send no reminder."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:420
msgid "Expiry Email"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:421
msgid "Email the vendor when their verified status is removed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:422
msgid "The email asks them to check their profile, listings and contact details and to get in touch to be verified again. Untick to remove the badge silently."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:431
msgid "Removing the Plugin"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:432
msgid "Your settings and every vendor's expiry date are kept if you delete this plugin, whatever the delete screen's generic warning says, unless you tick the box below. Deleting the plugin never removes anyone's verified status; it only stops the dates being checked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:437
msgid "Delete All Data"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:438
msgid "Delete this plugin's settings and vendor expiry dates when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:439
msgid "With this ticked, deleting the plugin also removes every setting on this page, the period and expiry date stored on each vendor, and your edited versions of its two emails, with no confirmation step and no undo. Vendors stay verified either way."
msgstr ""

